      en: ["The reserve was officially established on July 19, 1976.", "It covers a total area of approximately 14,416 hectares.", "In winter, over 50,000 waterfowl can be observed here at once.", "The area is recognized as a Ramsar site of international importance.", "The flamingo population often reaches several thousand birds in the autumn months.", "The 'EVOA' visitor center offers specialized areas for bird watching."],
